ted":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in 4.4.dev6 and 4.4.rc1, haven't tested other versions.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.rc1 - Linux Mint 22.1 (Xia) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 6800 XT (RADV NAVI21) - AMD Ryzen 5 3600 6-Core Processor (12 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf a table cell with top padding but no bottom padding is above a cell with no top padding, then instead of the first cell being padded above, there's a gap between the cells:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d159a91c-0552-4f43-b9fa-f5bf9e134a32)\n\nIn this example I would expect the whole table to be padded at the border with no padding between the cells.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nEnable BBCode on a RichTextLabel and populate it with this:\n```\n[table=1]\n[cell bg=black padding=9,9,9,0]Padding of 9, 9, 9, 0[/cell]\n[cell bg=black padding=9,0,9,0]Padding of 9, 0, 9, 0[/cell]\n[cell bg=black padding=9,0,9,0]Padding of 9, 0, 9, 0[/cell]\n[cell bg=black padding=9,0,9,9]Padding of 9, 0, 9, 9[/cell]\n[/table]\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[test-focus.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18934083/test-focus.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"lupuchard","id":2514990,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MTQ5OTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2514990?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lupuchard","html_url":"https://github.com/lupuchard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lupuchard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lupuchard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lupuchard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lupuchard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lupuchard/subscriptions","organiz